WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:26.100
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:36.160
- What?! 
- Did you not hear me?

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:42.060
Harry Burnsworth is the former King Machaty's illegitimate child.

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:45.570
Therefore...

00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:47.630
...he is the king of Raginei.

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:53.940
His daughter is first in line to succeed the throne.

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:57.660
It makes her, "Her Majesty."

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:05.780
Kajika is...

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:10.920
...to succeed the throne?!

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:17.300
<b>An Unstoppable Way</b>

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:25.930
It finally stopped raining.

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:31.050
Yea. If it stopped here, it means it'll start raining in Raginei.

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:37.270
With all due respect, you remind of Master Lee-Leng.

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:41.620
- Lee-Leng?  
- As the leader of the Huang Group...

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:47.260
...he has been hiding his desires deep inside his heart.

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:50.180
- Xiao-Ying. 
- Yes.

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:55.250
Do you think a day will come, where he can express his true feelings?

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:59.010
That's what I hope for.

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:12.790
Quinza! Is that you Quinza?!

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:17.890
I'm Najayra. You can't even differentiate between a man and woman anymore?

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:26.040
Quinza, don't leave my side! 
You're the only one I can trust!

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:30.020
How unfortunate. You don't even realize that you were betrayed.

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:36.580
Please, Quinza! 
 You told me I was fit to be the king!

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:42.020
Quinza! The one fit to be king is me and not Rumaty, right?!

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:44.480
Shut up!

00:03:48.590 --> 00:03:53.510
- It's starting to rain. 
 - At this pace it'll start raining harder at night.

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:58.450
It's fine, the rain muffles the noises.

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:01.530
It's perfect for a night raid.

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:05.760
Noei is at the hideout you found, right?

00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:08.010
Yes, there's no doubt.

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:11.420
I will get rid of them the same way I did with Sabaji.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:14.000
Good to know.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:18.500
But, we can't execute them as we arrest them.

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:20.460
Why is that?

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:23.790
The anti-king faction, that Sabaji was in charge of, was...

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:27.030
...a faction of the army that was misled.

00:04:27.690 --> 00:04:29.860
They weren't much different from terrorists.

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:33.630
The Rumaty faction that we're trying to get rid of now...

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:38.660
...is led by Noei, organized around the household troops.

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:44.740
Many of the members are tied to top politicians of this state.

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:49.100
- What about that? 
- If we capture them...

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:55.670
...we might be able to capture those who are secretly sided with the Rumaty faction.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:05:01.000
The Rumaty faction? There are traitors in the upper echelon of our government?

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:04.990
Unfortunately. 
 That's the only way to take it.

00:05:05.390 --> 00:05:09.530
They survived as long as they did holding less military power than Sabaji.

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:14.630
Doesn't that mean someone was leaking information about the secret police?

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:21.010
- That's what's going on?  
- In order to prove that, we need to capture them alive.

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:23.990
I got it. I will see you.

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:29.620
<i>If we can capture them alive...</i>

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:33.270
<i>...we can fabricate their confessions.</i>

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:37.690
<i>Even if there's no evidence, if we blame it on the dissidents...</i>

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:41.840
<i>...this government will fall apart and a revolution will be eminent.</i>

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:47.590
<i>But, Issac Noei, he's a tough one to deal with.</i>

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:53.320
<i>With Sabaji being executed, they know that they are next.</i>

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:56.240
<i>We must get rid of them immediately!</i>

00:05:56.540 --> 00:06:00.370
- Quinza. 
- Master Najayra.

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:05.790
I love your face when you are scheming. 
 It's so beautiful.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:10.270
How surprising. 
 Anything I can help you with?

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:14.830
I'm going to return to Chadli. 
 I heard my mother isn't feeling well.

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:18.250
That's not good.
 You should...

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:27.380
I wanted to hear your response.

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:31.490
- Response? 
- You know.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:38.420
Are you prepared to have your son become the king?

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:41.970
- Why would you say such a thing. 
- Answer me.

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:47.410
- I swear by Ragi.  
- Quinza!

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:53.430
<i>You won't be able to become the Queen, and neither will you be able to bear a child.</i>

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:58.790
<i>Because, the rightful heir to Ragi is His Highness Rumaty's son.</i>

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:04.270
<i>I can't wait until the day His Highness sits on the throne!</i>

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:06.710
<i>The day that he chooses his queen!</i>

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:10.920
<i>That's the only thing I long for in this life!</i>

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:21.300
Oh, it's pouring out there!

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:26.030
- Don't peek out too far. 
- I have to. I'm closing the window.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:34.660
- What is it? 
- Can I have a minute?

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:38.970
- How are you feeling Lee-Leng?
- Are we moving?

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:43.130
- You've got sharp senses.  
- Where are we going?

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:45.730
We don't know who's listening in on us.

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:48.500
I've only told Goslen where we're going.

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:51.190
Follow him.

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:55.080
But martial law hasn't been dissolved yet, right?

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:58.370
Right, that's why we're going underground.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:04.680
- Here?  
- I want to call it the magical pathway, but...

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:07.270
...this is just a vast underground waterway.

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:11.590
You'll walk for quite a bit in the dark and on uneven footing.

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:15.400
- Will you be OK?
 - Don't worry, it's nothing.

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:19.870
There must be a reason for me to go now, right?

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:24.560
- You're sharp. It's as you think   
- That means...

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:29.190
Kajika, once you escape, return home with Lee-Leng.

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:33.760
- What, why?  
- You've done more than enough for us.

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:38.720
- I can't have you stay in this country any longer. 
- But, I haven't done anything yet.

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:42.620
You've brought His Highness Rumaty's word to us.

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:46.570
- You don't know how encouraged our comrades were.   
- Isaac.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:50.000
Now, I want you to encourage His Highness Rumaty.

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:53.300
We promise that we'll go back to get him.

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:58.540
- Master Kajika.  
- Sergeant.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:04.790
I think I got the right size this time.

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:07.580
What is this?

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:09.990
I'm sorry.

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:13.330
I'm really grateful! Thank you!

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:18.410
- Are they here already?!   
- Goslen!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:21.180
Follow me!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:25.520
- Kajika, hurry!  
- What? But.

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:36.710
Duck!

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:41.980
- Hurry!  
- But!

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:45.790
Godspeed!

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:57.520
- We'll escape from the roof! Diverge the enemy's eyes so Kajika can escape! - Yes, sir!

00:09:58.140 --> 00:10:01.090
- Don't die in vain!   
- Yes, sir!

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:26.420
- Are we all accounted for?!   
- Yes, sir!

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:29.400
- Are you alright, Lee-Leng?   
- Yea.

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:33.830
Watch your step. It's slippery. 
 This way.

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:40.730
Wait, where's Isaac?! And the sergeant that gave me the shirt?!

00:10:42.230 --> 00:10:44.320
Neither, the lieutenant nor the sergeant are coming.

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:49.960
The other members are going to diverge the enemy and escape from a different route.

00:10:50.230 --> 00:10:54.010
- No! 
- That's what they were planning to do from the beginning?

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:57.540
Yes, the lieutenant mentioned that his face is too well known, so...

00:10:57.700 --> 00:11:00.530
...he ordered me to escort you two.

00:11:00.650 --> 00:11:02.870
What! No!

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:06.130
I left that shirt there!

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:09.570
What if I'm not able to see them anymore?! 
 That's the last thing that they...

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:13.240
Don't worry! You'll be able to reunite with them, alive!

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:16.250
No, that's not what I meant!

00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:20.400
I have all these thoughts running through my head and my heart is racing!

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:22.750
Hurry!

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:27.520
<i>Why, why am I doing this?!</i>

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:39.140
<i>Why are people from the same country killing each other?</i>

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:53.490
<i>There's no good reason for this.</i>

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:59.050
<i>There's no good reason to take each other's lives! 
 But why?!</i>

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:04.720
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:11.300
We're entering the side road. It's like a maze so don't lose sight.

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:20.860
<i>Again...</i>

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:28.910
I want you to take this outside of the palace without it being seen.

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:32.160
Do you think I can do it?

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:37.320
You can, you can change.

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:56.430
Ragi! 
 God of the Sun!

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:06.560
<i>My father only has revenge against Burnsworth on his mind. </i>

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:12.220
Whatever I say or do won't matter.

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:15.670
Young Master, did you call me?

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:20.030
Can you contact the bodyguards from Raginei for me?

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:25.160
- Yes, sir. 
- Can you gather them? It's an emergency.

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:27.140
Yes, yes sir.

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:32.080
<i>Kajika.</i>

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:38.320
<i>I will protect my own way!</i>

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:48.630
Underground waterway?!

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:52.310
Yes, it seems like some of them have escaped there.

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:55.770
They've noticed! I'm counting on you Goslen!

00:13:57.670 --> 00:14:00.510
What was that?! 
 Wait!

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:07.490
The shortest route may be monitored by the secret police.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:11.090
- This route may take longer... 
 - I don't mind.

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:16.400
Kajika.

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:26.010
Roger!

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:30.550
Hurry! Hide yourselves in that hole and be quiet!

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:35.160
What's at the end of this hole?

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:39.770
- It's a dead end. 
 - Goslen, do you have two guns?

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:43.220
- Yes, I do.  
- Can you let me borrow one?

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:47.660
- I'll go.   
- No.

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:51.180
I'll kill one for sure. 
 While they're carried away...

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:55.660
- ...you get rid of the rest.  
- Wait a minute. If that's the case I'll...

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:58.980
No! I won't be able to get out of this maze alone!

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:01.850
The priority is to have Kajika escape!

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:04.680
No, I won't allow that!

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:07.420
I won't allow you to kill someone!

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:11.370
- There's no time to argue about that!  
- No!

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:14.960
- Kajika!
- I understand what you're saying, Lee-Leng.

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:17.760
I won't allow you to harm someone!

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:20.620
That's not the reason why we came here!

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:24.600
Leave it up to me. I have a good idea!

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:29.680
- But...  
- No, I am also your bodyguard.

00:15:30.020 --> 00:15:35.380
I don't care!
 This is the only way no one will be harmed.

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:46.920
Goslen!

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:58.960
- Did you really hear it?  
- Yea, I heard a woman's voice.

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:04.160
Who is that?

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:07.370
Don't shoot me! 
 I surrender.

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:12.010
Alright, come out slowly with your hands up.

00:16:12.470 --> 00:16:14.990
I knew you guys were hiding.

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:22.230
- What about the rest of you! 
- Inside that hole.

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:27.000
- But, a special guest is in there.   
- Special guest?

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:32.430
There is no one that's special that disobeys the king.

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:34.630
If you think so, look inside.

00:16:38.820 --> 00:16:43.150
It's bright. I told you it's bright.

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:47.580
- Your Highness Rumaty! 
 - What?!

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:52.700
This can't be! 
Why would he be here?!

00:16:52.960 --> 00:16:56.030
How rude! 
Don't point a gun at royalty!

00:16:58.980 --> 00:17:01.010
<i>This isn't going to work!</i>

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:08.260
Are you going to point a gun at me?!

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:11.960
But, Your Highness, you are against the king.

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:17.640
You fools! When did I disobey the king?!
 Everything is fabricated, don't you realize?!

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:28.030
- I apologize! 
- Please forgive us!

00:17:30.870 --> 00:17:35.150
I am here to save this country from destruction.

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:37.710
Destruction?!

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:41.210
Raginei has become the orphan of the world.

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:45.080
But we are spending the limited resources on infighting.

00:17:45.650 --> 00:17:48.750
What else but a road of destruction is this?!

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:56.480
- All I want to do is to stop that.  
- Your Highness.

00:17:57.410 --> 00:18:01.690
- Raise your faces.  
- <i>What is she...</i>

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:09.150
You're forgiven. Come back to my side.

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:19.090
- Help my cause. 
 Your Highness!

00:18:20.170 --> 00:18:24.580
<i>This can't be! Even though it's dark they're close enough to realize it!</i>

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:29.030
<i>There's no way that they're not going to realize that she's not Rumaty.</i>

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:34.520
<i>But, it's not her appearance. 
 It's what she said.</i>

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:38.030
<i>It's the dignity and demeanor only a royalty possesses.</i>

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:42.380
<i>That's what's making them think that she is Rumaty. It's not acting...</i>

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:46.110
<i>...it's the destiny that Kajika was born with.</i>

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:57.210
- This route does not have any of the guards. Please hurry. 
- OK.

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:04.290
I was surprised. I didn't know it was going to work this well.

00:19:04.440 --> 00:19:07.990
Everyone tells me that I'm just like Rumaty.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:11.490
<i>Kajika is falling deeper and deeper.</i>

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:15.620
<i>Even if I try to keep her from doing so.</i>

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:20.730
<i>It is as though she knows that she is part of the royal family.</i>

00:19:21.980 --> 00:19:25.010
<i>If it keeps going like this, we won't be able to escape this country.</i>

00:19:26.050 --> 00:19:28.570
<i>Kajika will leave!
 Will leave me!</i>

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:39.550
<i>Brother Lee-Leng!</i>

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:42.350
<i>As long as there are weights that hold me down.</i>

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:47.590
<i>Don't forget your position as the leader of the Huangs.</i>

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.750
<i>As long as there are shackles that bind me.</i>

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:56.040
<i>If it stays like this, I won't be able to protect Kajika!</i>

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:06.260
Sergeant!

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:11.070
Sergeant! Hold on!

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:16.140
Please escape while you can! I can't go any longer.

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:18.830
Don't be foolish! Don't give up!

00:20:24.470 --> 00:20:28.370
You are surrounded! 
 Throw your weapons away!

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:37.640
- Lieutenant. 
- I leave the rest up to Goslen.

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:55.020
- Are you awake?!
- Kajika.

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:59.740
You were sweating a lot so I was wiping it. 
 Did it hurt?

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:06.440
Your wounds opened up a little. They said to stay in bed and you'll be OK.

00:21:07.760 --> 00:21:10.140
Is this the new hideout?

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:16.030
Goslen is going to arrange our way out of this country later.

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:17.790
Alright.

00:21:19.530 --> 00:21:23.410
Lee-Leng, I'm not going to go back.

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:29.550
Spending time with Isaac made me realize.

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:33.210
That I love the people of this country.

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:36.580
I love this country, a lot!

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:38.530
Kajika!

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:41.870
I want to be able to do something for this country.

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:43.560
But...

00:21:44.460 --> 00:21:49.520
I realized from yesterday's incident, that the royalty of this country is not normal.

00:21:50.180 --> 00:21:52.270
Their existence is their religion.

00:21:52.810 --> 00:21:57.820
If I'm able to make people believe that Rumaty is back in the country...

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:03.910
...I can change a part, a part of this country!

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:14.160
There's an emergency!
 Lieutenant Noei was arrested!

00:22:38.840 --> 00:22:41.530
How is Sezun doing?

00:22:45.900 --> 00:22:49.670
- It's been a while Noei. 
- Quinza!

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:08.190
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:16.090
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.400 --> 00:23:22.700
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.330 --> 00:23:27.900
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.020 --> 00:23:37.460
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.500 --> 00:23:44.640
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.660 --> 00:23:52.120
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.120 --> 00:23:59.210
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.790 --> 00:24:06.740
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.130 --> 00:24:14.120
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.470 --> 00:24:24.260
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
